[[Image:Chokingpowder.gif|left]]
'''Choking powder''' is made from various herbs and causes uncontrollable coughing fits. A pack of choking powder can create a small [[stinking cloud]] that will last for 5 [[round]]s. The cloud forces anyone within it to make a [[fortitude]] [[saving throw]] versus poison ([[DC]] 16) or become [[dazed]] for 2 rounds. [[Spell resistance]] does not apply.

== Notes ==
* Introduced in the [[expansion pack]]s.

